      "writtenOn": "2016-10-13T22:51:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess this will work on the platforms that we support, since I think they all use 32-bit ints. However, it would be better to make this a compile-time failure, if feature_set is larger than 32 bits. E.g.\n\n  static_assert(sizeof(set) \u003d\u003d sizeof(uint32_t), \"Some features can not be represented in output\");",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "7c3468719049a7f4702e9258aeb588162824bf27",
